```text
Internet
   │
   ▼
Caddy (TLS reverse proxy)
   │
   ├── /        → Directus (admin + public API)
   ├── /flow    → n8n
   └── /minio   → MinIO console
                │
                ▼
          PostgreSQL
                │
                ├── metadata
                └── OCR results

upload scan
   ↓
MinIO bucket (raw-scans)
   ↓
n8n trigger
   ↓
PaddleOCR worker
   ↓
parsed JSON
   ↓
Directus collections
   ↓
Volunteer validation
   ↓
Published memorial page
```

