---

# Caddyfile

```caddy
yourdomain.com {

 reverse_proxy / directus:8055

 handle_path /flow/* {
   reverse_proxy n8n:5678
 }

 handle_path /minio/* {
   reverse_proxy minio:9001
 }
}
```

